-- PipePairPeers4 — the ChainSync CLIENT per-peer bisim of the FourNode
-- node-side pipeline milestone (M1, Part 13).
--
-- `CSclientA l hi ≈DR csClientSpec l hi`, ∀ (l : Link).  The mirror of the
-- CS server (PipePairPeers3): the api trigger sits at idle (→ wire send),
-- wire receives sit at the await states (→ value-gated api emit).  The
-- api-emit gates carry products/Tip; their DecEq instances are pinned
-- (`⦃ DecEqI.DecEq-× ⦄`) to break the CS instance leak.  20-ctor relation
-- (5 home react + 5 loop re-entry sils + 8 intermediate react + deadlock).
--
-- No postulates, holes, or `NON_TERMINATING`.  Script-generated
-- (`.superpowers/sdd/gen-cs-client-bisim.py`; only the Agda is committed).
------------------------------------------------------------------------

